{"seq":4,"slug":"regulation","title":"保险监管与系统性风险","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solvency-capital-regulation","title":"偿付能力与资本监管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation/solvency-capital-regulation","wordCount":1973,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"consumer-protection-regulation","title":"消费者保护监管","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation/consumer-protection-regulation","wordCount":2273,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"insurance-and-systemic-risk","title":"保险与系统性风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/insurance-economics/regulation/insurance-and-systemic-risk","wordCount":2304,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 保险监管与系统性风险\n\n本章探讨保险行业的监管逻辑与制度设计。保险不同于一般商品市场：保费在前、赔付在后，保险公司承诺的是未来的给付能力。这种\"倒置的生产周期\"使得偿付能力监管成为保险监管的核心支柱。\n\n三篇文档覆盖监管的三个维度：偿付能力与资本充足性监管（确保保险公司有能力履约）、消费者保护监管（确保保险消费者不被不当对待），以及保险与系统性风险的关系（AIG 危机后的新认知）。\n"}